# Large / regenerable state — never commit.
cache/
dryrun/
artifacts/checkpoints/
artifacts/_smoke/
artifacts/train.log
artifacts/records.jsonl
artifacts/progress.json
artifacts/*.duckdb
artifacts/*.duckdb.wal
*.pt
__pycache__/

# DO commit the small result artifacts the notebook/manuscript render:
#   artifacts/multitask_metrics.json, artifacts/learning_curves.npz,
#   artifacts/ensemble_uncertainty.json, artifacts/ensemble_predictions.npz,
#   figures/*.png
# The DuckDB lineage store (artifacts/*.duckdb) is regenerable via `make campaign`;
# campaign_learned.json records its path and per-endpoint experiment IDs instead.
